# =====================================================================
# HR On Call marketing sites (hr / associate / plymouth subdomains)
# One repo, three docroots. See deploy/README.md.
# =====================================================================

# ---- SECRETS. Real keys live on the server only.
# secrets.php holds the Brevo API key and the reCAPTCHA SECRET key. The
# reCAPTCHA SITE key is public (it is rendered into the page) and stays in git.
# ats/config.php holds the database password.
# NOTE: patterns below are deliberately unanchored (**/ or bare name).
# A pattern containing a slash, e.g. "ats/config.php", is anchored to the repo
# ROOT and would NOT match associate.on-call.co.uk/ats/config.php. That mistake
# let a Brevo key reach a commit; GitHub push protection caught it.
**/includes/secrets.php
secrets.php
**/ats/config.php
.env
.env.local
.claude/

# ---- Runtime output and user data
uploads/
logs/
error_log
*.log

# ---- Composer dependencies (restore with: composer install)
vendor/

# ---- Old hand-made backup copies. Git history replaces these.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak.*
*.backup
*~

# ---- Large media: keep on the server, git handles binaries badly.
# Two 84MB/31MB demo videos were removed from these sites on 2026-08-16;
# they were unreferenced duplicates of the ones on the CRM.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.zip

# ---- Server-managed
.well-known/
cgi-bin/

# ---- OS and editor cruft (desktop.ini appears because of OneDrive)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
